WEBVTT

01:30.080 --> 01:32.672
[Episode 2]

01:39.552 --> 01:42.233
[Bofeng]

01:42.233 --> 01:43.272
Everyone.

01:43.272 --> 01:48.033
Today's special at Bofeng
is Miss Situ's favorite Spring-Autumn Pastry.

01:48.033 --> 01:50.992
Crafted from fruits
of different seasonal blooms,

01:50.992 --> 01:52.233
it's yours for just ten taels of silver.

01:52.233 --> 01:55.073
You can also
enjoy Miss Situ's signature brews.

01:55.073 --> 01:56.513
Please choose as you please.

01:56.513 --> 01:59.433
- I want it!
- I want it!

02:13.473 --> 02:16.593
I was wondering
what that strong sheep smell was.

02:16.593 --> 02:18.993
Isn't this Wen
I expelled from the Women's Academy?

02:19.752 --> 02:23.313
You stinking shepherd, why are you
doing odd jobs in a place like this?

02:23.313 --> 02:26.672
I wonder if Yan Fu Zhi
is running a restaurant or a charity house.

02:26.672 --> 02:29.313
Exactly! This restaurant
will be run into the ground sooner or later.

02:31.393 --> 02:32.433
Catch her!

02:34.632 --> 02:36.472
Let go of me! What are you doing?

02:36.472 --> 02:37.553
What do you want?

02:37.553 --> 02:39.472
Let go of me! Let go of me!

02:39.472 --> 02:43.593
Only Yan Fu Zhi and Meng Ting Hui
dared to disobey me in the Academy.

02:43.593 --> 02:45.672
Now, you work for Yan Fu Zhi.

02:45.672 --> 02:47.912
Isn't that just picking a fight with me?

02:47.912 --> 02:51.192
Mei Er, I'm just here to do odd jobs.

02:51.192 --> 02:52.192
Please.

02:54.833 --> 02:56.192
How dare you call me Mei Er?

03:01.113 --> 03:03.033
This sheep stench is giving me a headache.

03:03.912 --> 03:05.273
She needs a good wash.

03:07.313 --> 03:09.833
Let go of me! Let go of me!

03:12.792 --> 03:14.593
Didn't they say Yan Fu Zhi has your back?

03:15.632 --> 03:18.232
Let's see if she'll come to help you.

03:18.873 --> 03:19.873
No!

03:22.352 --> 03:24.313
No! Please, I beg you!

03:28.072 --> 03:29.072
Stop!

03:31.512 --> 03:32.553
Please!

03:41.672 --> 03:42.672
Let's go.

03:43.554 --> 03:46.113
What exactly did Wen do to you?

03:46.113 --> 03:47.472
How could you be so ruthless?

03:48.512 --> 03:50.273
You're finally here.

03:50.273 --> 03:54.192
I heard you hired someone named Situ Xue,
who's very popular here.

03:54.192 --> 03:55.672
Go call her out.

03:55.672 --> 03:59.713
I highly doubt there's anyone in Shazhou
more beautiful than me.

03:59.713 --> 04:00.713
Get out!

04:03.912 --> 04:06.153
Smash Bofeng!

04:07.273 --> 04:08.273
You...

04:08.912 --> 04:09.952
If you dare to smash it,

04:09.952 --> 04:12.952
just forget about doing silk business
with the Yan family ever again.

04:12.952 --> 04:13.952
Mei Er.

04:13.952 --> 04:16.033
Wen has no power or influence,
but the Yan family is the wealthiest here.

04:16.033 --> 04:18.912
- Stop!
- They do carry some weight in Shazhou.

04:18.912 --> 04:20.472
My uncle is the Governor of Shazhou.

04:20.472 --> 04:22.472
And behind him
is the Left Chancellor, Lord Xu.

04:22.472 --> 04:23.992
If you don't even have the guts to do this,

04:23.992 --> 04:25.273
go back to your silk shop right now.

04:25.273 --> 04:26.432
Don't embarrass yourself in front of me.

04:27.353 --> 04:28.353
Get lost!

04:28.353 --> 04:30.513
Stop! Let go of her!

04:30.513 --> 04:33.312
Smash! Smash it hard!

04:37.593 --> 04:38.593
Stop!

04:43.273 --> 04:44.273
My face...

04:44.273 --> 04:45.833
Let go of me!

04:45.833 --> 04:48.472
Blood? My face...

04:48.472 --> 04:49.472
Let go of me!

04:51.593 --> 04:54.552
You dare hit me? Are you tired of living?

04:54.552 --> 04:56.232
Where is your good friend now?

04:56.232 --> 04:57.792
Why isn't she here to save you?

04:59.112 --> 05:01.073
If I don't see Situ Xue today,

05:01.073 --> 05:03.513
I will turn Bofeng into ruins.

05:04.792 --> 05:07.713
Stop! Aren't you looking for me?

05:07.713 --> 05:08.713
Let go of her.

05:13.312 --> 05:14.312
Miss.

05:37.432 --> 05:38.833
When did you come back?

05:38.833 --> 05:39.992
That's none of your business.

05:39.992 --> 05:41.912
I'm here to do something
I've always wanted to do.

06:18.992 --> 06:21.393
Meng Ting Hui, it's actually you.

06:22.232 --> 06:25.713
You lowly orphan. How dare you
pose as the top dancer of the capital?

06:25.713 --> 06:28.513
Jiang Mei Er, I'll give you a chance.

06:28.513 --> 06:30.312
Kowtow and admit your mistake.

06:30.312 --> 06:31.792
Pay double compensation.

06:31.792 --> 06:32.792
Otherwise,

06:38.352 --> 06:39.953
we will perish together today.

06:43.112 --> 06:44.273
You think you're worthy?

06:58.352 --> 07:01.872
Meng, you've got an exam to take.
It's not worth to risk your life.

07:01.872 --> 07:05.432
To deal with a maniac,
I naturally need crazy tactics.

07:05.432 --> 07:06.513
My life is worthless.

07:07.394 --> 07:11.112
Taking you spoiled descendants
of officials down with me

07:11.112 --> 07:12.112
is more than worth it.

07:13.672 --> 07:17.633
Jiang Mei Er,
didn't you want to turn Bofeng into ruins?

07:17.633 --> 07:19.073
I'll help you.

07:19.073 --> 07:21.593
Let's burn us all to death.

07:27.432 --> 07:28.472
Meng Ting Hui, you madwoman!

07:28.472 --> 07:29.753
Scared now?

07:30.633 --> 07:33.992
Weren't you happy
when you were bullying others?

07:33.992 --> 07:35.352
Meng Ting Hui, you've gone too far!

07:36.112 --> 07:39.872
Mr. Song, do you want to die with them?

07:40.633 --> 07:41.792
I'll grant your wish.

07:42.992 --> 07:43.992
Mei Er,

07:43.992 --> 07:45.634
she's been stealing, cheating,
and just cruel since childhood.

07:45.634 --> 07:47.153
We don't need to risk our lives against her.

07:47.153 --> 07:48.312
You useless fool!

07:49.953 --> 07:51.312
My patience is running out.

07:51.312 --> 07:53.513
If you don't kowtow, apologize,
and pay compensation now,

07:54.992 --> 07:56.232
then we all die together.

07:58.872 --> 08:01.552
- Meng Ting Hui, I was wrong. I'll pay.
- You...

08:01.552 --> 08:03.472
Fu Zhi, take the money.

08:06.193 --> 08:07.193
Mr. Song,

08:07.193 --> 08:09.872
who do you think is more beautiful,
me or Jiang Mei Er?

08:09.872 --> 08:11.352
You are more beautiful!
You are the most beautiful!

08:11.352 --> 08:12.992
So what about Jiang Mei Er?

08:12.992 --> 08:14.232
Jiang Mei Er is an ugly one,

08:14.232 --> 08:15.472
like a toad and a dung beetle.

08:15.472 --> 08:16.472
Just a slobbering fool.

08:17.552 --> 08:19.273
You useless fool!

08:22.912 --> 08:26.593
Meng Ting Hui, Yan Fu Zhi, I was wrong.

08:26.593 --> 08:28.953
She forced me to do this.

08:29.912 --> 08:32.233
She once scalded me with boiling water too.

08:33.592 --> 08:35.273
You two useless ones!

08:36.353 --> 08:38.792
Meng Ting Hui, I'll kill you!

08:51.192 --> 08:54.153
I was wrong. Meng Ting Hui, I was wrong.

08:55.513 --> 08:56.712
I'll also pay for it.

08:56.712 --> 08:58.353
Take off all your jewelry.

08:58.353 --> 08:59.353
Okay.

09:03.672 --> 09:05.473
Here. Help me take it off!

09:17.353 --> 09:18.353
Is that enough?

09:20.672 --> 09:21.993
Kowtow and admit your mistake.

09:23.153 --> 09:24.153
Move aside.

09:31.233 --> 09:33.633
Your kowtow was too light. I didn't hear it.

09:49.912 --> 09:52.353
I've done everything you said.

09:53.393 --> 09:55.993
Can you let us go now?

10:06.473 --> 10:07.672
Why are they all dusty and disheveled?

10:07.672 --> 10:09.312
They look so pathetic.

10:09.312 --> 10:11.513
What are you looking at?
There's nothing to see!

10:12.273 --> 10:14.113
You go first. Go!

10:15.952 --> 10:16.993
Move aside!

10:17.680 --> 10:21.144
[Bofeng]

10:27.712 --> 10:28.912
120.

10:29.792 --> 10:30.832
40.

10:34.473 --> 10:35.473
20.

10:36.912 --> 10:37.912
10.

10:38.792 --> 10:39.792
10.

10:41.993 --> 10:44.312
Meng, over three hundred taels.

10:45.312 --> 10:47.153
Apart from treating Wen's injuries,

10:47.153 --> 10:49.192
it's enough to renovate Bofeng entirely.

10:49.192 --> 10:52.473
Who knows how much these parasites
have exploited the people?

10:52.473 --> 10:53.513
Might as well rip them off.

10:54.792 --> 10:56.153
Just consider it
as robbing the rich to help the poor.

10:57.432 --> 10:59.952
Send the money to Wen tonight.

10:59.952 --> 11:01.233
Don't delay her treatment.

11:01.233 --> 11:02.233
Okay.

11:03.672 --> 11:06.192
But Meng, you scared me to death just now.

11:06.192 --> 11:07.192
What if...

11:09.993 --> 11:11.192
It was fake.

11:11.192 --> 11:15.033
This specially designed phosphorus powder
was prepared for Situ Xue's performance.

11:15.033 --> 11:16.072
It just happened to come in handy.

11:18.113 --> 11:19.113
Meng,

11:19.832 --> 11:23.072
I'm sorry for dragging you into this.

11:23.072 --> 11:25.192
Shazhou is a place that devours people.

11:25.192 --> 11:27.432
Only through the Imperial Exam
can one get out.

11:27.432 --> 11:30.273
Besides, Jiang Mei Er won't let us off.

11:31.273 --> 11:33.113
It's trivial that Bofeng got smashed.

11:33.113 --> 11:34.832
If it affects your Provincial Exam...

11:34.832 --> 11:36.153
I study to become an official,

11:37.673 --> 11:39.832
just to protect those I want to protect.

11:40.592 --> 11:44.033
I couldn't protect Xiang ten years ago.

11:46.153 --> 11:47.753
If I fail to protect you again today,

11:48.393 --> 11:50.993
I'd rather not have this official position.

11:52.634 --> 11:55.113
If only you were a boy.

11:57.072 --> 11:58.672
I would definitely marry you.

12:06.233 --> 12:10.753
Fu Zhi, be gentler. I can't breathe.

12:10.753 --> 12:12.873
No, I won't let go.

12:12.873 --> 12:14.873
I won't let go for the rest of my life.

12:15.832 --> 12:19.873
You will surely soar to great heights.

12:19.873 --> 12:25.113
And then, we'll go to the capital together.

12:30.552 --> 12:31.633
Fu Zhi.

12:31.633 --> 12:33.873
After all that commotion with Jiang Mei Er,
I almost forgot.

12:33.873 --> 12:35.873
I made your favorite apricot skin cakes.

12:42.034 --> 12:44.513
Xiang loved apricot skin cakes the most.

12:49.233 --> 12:50.272
In a few more days,

12:52.512 --> 12:54.633
it's her death anniversary.

12:57.513 --> 13:00.393
When the time comes, I'll go with you.

13:20.993 --> 13:23.033
Close the doors and windows!

13:24.153 --> 13:26.552
Beware of thieves and robbers!

13:26.552 --> 13:28.896
[Night watch]

13:30.393 --> 13:32.832
Close the doors and windows!

13:33.633 --> 13:36.432
Beware of thieves and robbers!

13:44.873 --> 13:47.153
Let go! Let go of me!

13:47.153 --> 13:48.712
Let go of me!

13:48.712 --> 13:50.712
Let go of me!

13:51.753 --> 13:54.072
Let go of me! Let go!

13:54.072 --> 13:55.072
Let go of me!

13:56.473 --> 13:58.592
Let go of me! Let go!

13:58.592 --> 14:00.072
Let go of me!

14:03.113 --> 14:05.792
Xiang!

14:40.552 --> 14:42.993
We meet again, Miss Meng.

14:49.034 --> 14:52.192
You really are a swindler
who'd kill for money.

14:54.192 --> 14:55.592
I was just protecting myself.

14:56.912 --> 14:58.753
Master, you are too narrow-minded.

14:58.753 --> 15:00.393
To deal with a weak woman like me,

15:00.393 --> 15:03.153
you go to such lengths.
Aren't you afraid of the ridicule?

15:03.153 --> 15:04.432
Weak woman?

15:06.393 --> 15:08.912
Master, you've seen her.

15:08.912 --> 15:11.513
The Left Chancellor ordered you
to return to the capital tonight.

15:12.513 --> 15:14.153
Wait for me outside.

15:14.153 --> 15:15.513
Master, it's getting late.

15:15.513 --> 15:16.513
Get out!

15:30.513 --> 15:34.033
Keep a close watch. We must
get the master back to the capital tonight.

15:34.033 --> 15:35.033
Yes!

15:39.552 --> 15:41.153
I am narrow-minded?

15:41.153 --> 15:44.552
If Huo An weren't my man,
I would have already died.

15:44.552 --> 15:46.673
You betray others and are so scheming.

15:46.673 --> 15:50.633
Even if you become an official,
you will be a treacherous one.

15:54.072 --> 15:56.113
You have so much power,

15:56.113 --> 15:57.993
yet you don't
go after Heihu Crew and Ding Chong,

15:57.993 --> 16:01.233
but pick on a woman like me.
Is that all you've got?

16:01.993 --> 16:03.353
You dare deceive me?

16:03.353 --> 16:05.072
You're dead meat.

16:13.034 --> 16:16.072
Why do I always run into you, you jinx?

16:16.072 --> 16:17.073
- If you want to leave, just leave.
- Go!

16:17.073 --> 16:18.873
Can't you use the outside door?

16:18.873 --> 16:19.993
You broke all my doors and windows.

16:19.993 --> 16:21.912
How am I supposed to do business?

16:21.912 --> 16:23.993
Fine! If you leave, don't ever come back.

16:23.993 --> 16:25.273
Don't let me see you again.

16:25.273 --> 16:26.672
You shameless fool.

16:26.672 --> 16:27.993
You jinx.

16:27.993 --> 16:29.552
Don't come back! You're shameless!

16:29.552 --> 16:30.552
Chase!

16:48.192 --> 16:51.513
Miss Meng, you are quite the scold.
Are you quite satisfied now?

16:53.312 --> 16:54.993
To help you escape,

16:54.993 --> 16:57.552
I had to make my insults sound genuine,
so they'd believe it's real.

17:01.033 --> 17:03.673
We're even now.

17:03.673 --> 17:05.913
Can we ever be even?

17:07.713 --> 17:09.592
I'm thirsty. Serve me some tea.

17:12.872 --> 17:15.072
Still putting on airs while being chased?

17:21.433 --> 17:24.592
Ding Chong exploits the people
and commits all kinds of evil.

17:24.592 --> 17:26.513
Why don't you go to the capital
and file an imperial complaint?

17:33.112 --> 17:34.392
You make it sound easy.

17:35.513 --> 17:38.392
Without Ding Chong's travel permit,

17:38.392 --> 17:40.753
not a single fly can slip out of Shazhou.

17:40.753 --> 17:43.832
Those who snuck to the capital
were intercepted and killed midway.

17:43.832 --> 17:45.552
It is a pity
that His Majesty sits upon his throne,

17:46.233 --> 17:50.152
surrounded by flattery,
but blind to the hardships of the people.

17:54.913 --> 17:57.152
The Left Chancellor
holds all power in the court.

17:57.832 --> 18:00.193
What His Majesty sees and hears
is all filtered.

18:00.193 --> 18:02.552
It's not that His Majesty
doesn't know the hardships of the people,

18:02.552 --> 18:04.513
but that someone deliberately conceals them.

18:04.513 --> 18:05.513
His Majesty

18:07.513 --> 18:09.112
is also not in control of his own will.

18:10.152 --> 18:12.273
The two chancellors' cliques
are completely tangled up,

18:12.273 --> 18:13.632
always spouting about old-school propriety.

18:14.673 --> 18:17.112
I bet they despise the idea
of women engaging in politics.

18:17.112 --> 18:19.913
Yet, His Majesty
insists on using women as a blade

18:20.552 --> 18:22.433
to shatter this decaying system.

18:22.433 --> 18:25.352
In the future, he will also
embrace talents of humble origins

18:25.352 --> 18:26.753
and enact institutional reforms.

18:26.753 --> 18:28.112
If you pass the Imperial Examination,

18:29.033 --> 18:32.392
will you dare denounce the Left Chancellor
as hidebound one before the court?

18:32.392 --> 18:33.552
More than that.

18:34.953 --> 18:38.792
Darkness exists because someone in the court
holds an umbrella for it.

18:39.592 --> 18:43.193
One day, when I enter the Throne Hall,

18:43.193 --> 18:45.112
I will burn those umbrellas
with my own hands.

18:45.872 --> 18:49.673
Not yet an official,
yet daring discuss state affairs recklessly.

18:52.033 --> 18:53.433
Do your best in the Provincial Exam.

18:53.433 --> 18:54.433
See you again.

18:58.392 --> 18:59.592
May we never meet again.

19:06.673 --> 19:07.953
<i>He's actually a capital official.</i>

19:11.829 --> 19:14.208
[Sacred Ancestral Hall]

19:47.713 --> 19:51.273
[Sacred Ancestral Hall]
Your Majesty, during five days of seclusion,

19:51.273 --> 19:53.033
you only have one vegetarian meal every day.

19:53.753 --> 19:57.112
I am truly worried about your health.

19:57.112 --> 19:59.312
You must eat properly.

19:59.312 --> 20:01.473
The Left Chancellor has arrived!

20:10.112 --> 20:11.112
Lord Xu.

20:15.872 --> 20:18.392
Lord Xu, you absolutely must not enter!

20:18.392 --> 20:21.632
Without His Majesty's decree, no one
is allowed to enter Sacred Ancestral Hall.

20:27.033 --> 20:28.033
You...

20:28.033 --> 20:31.312
Lord Xu,
please don't make things difficult for me.

20:31.312 --> 20:32.312
Move aside!

20:42.913 --> 20:43.913
Close the door.

21:02.872 --> 21:03.993
Lord Xu,

21:05.832 --> 21:08.872
you're still not resting at such a late hour?

21:08.872 --> 21:12.072
Have you come
specially to bring me a chicken leg?

21:12.072 --> 21:15.392
I'm about to starve to death here.

21:17.312 --> 21:18.312
Ridiculous!

21:18.953 --> 21:21.792
His Majesty has gone wild in Shazhou.

21:21.792 --> 21:23.592
Set off for Shazhou immediately.

21:24.312 --> 21:27.112
Bring His Majesty back in five days.

21:27.112 --> 21:32.792
Lord Xu, just the journey to Shazhou
takes more than five days.

21:33.913 --> 21:35.312
Take my token.

21:35.312 --> 21:36.433
Travel day and night.

21:36.433 --> 21:40.072
All post stations along the way
will prepare fast horses for you.

21:40.072 --> 21:42.792
Five days? I...

21:47.033 --> 21:51.632
You impersonated His Majesty.
This is an unforgivable crime.

21:51.632 --> 21:52.993
You should be executed immediately.

21:52.993 --> 21:55.513
Five days. Just five days.

22:02.832 --> 22:04.632
[Shazhou]
Your Majesty, I am late.

22:05.392 --> 22:06.392
How is the military situation?

22:07.392 --> 22:09.592
Currently,
Shazhou has ten battalions stationed.

22:09.592 --> 22:12.312
But all the city barracks
are dilapidated and unmaintained.

22:12.312 --> 22:15.072
Rusted armor and weapons in the army
are beyond counting.

22:15.072 --> 22:18.632
The money allocated by the court
has never been used for military equipment.

22:21.832 --> 22:26.312
Under the name of a military fortress,
Shazhou has been bleeding the court dry

22:26.312 --> 22:28.193
for endless rations and funds every year.

22:29.112 --> 22:32.832
Xu Ting has indulged them completely,
giving whatever they ask for.

22:32.832 --> 22:35.513
Even now, the soldiers remain weak,
and the horses are still feeble.

22:35.513 --> 22:37.832
If there is even one corrupt official
in the court,

22:37.832 --> 22:40.433
and a whole region of Ning Empire rots.

22:40.433 --> 22:44.352
Your Majesty, excluding the journey back,
we have two days left.

22:44.352 --> 22:45.473
What should we do next?

22:46.792 --> 22:48.632
Ding Chong and the Ministry of War
are in cahoots.

22:48.632 --> 22:50.193
They are all Xu Ting's henchmen.

22:51.033 --> 22:52.352
I'd like to see

22:53.352 --> 22:57.832
how many more dirty dealings are buried
under the sand of Shazhou.

23:08.673 --> 23:10.592
- Here, Miss.
- Thank you.

23:10.592 --> 23:11.673
Take your time.

23:11.673 --> 23:12.673
Okay.

23:13.832 --> 23:14.832
Private room number one upstairs.

23:16.233 --> 23:19.632
Gentlemen, here's your wine. Please enjoy.

23:19.632 --> 23:21.713
Okay, come on. Cheers!

23:21.713 --> 23:23.872
Meng. Meng,

23:23.872 --> 23:25.033
look at this lively atmosphere.

23:25.033 --> 23:28.112
I thought it would be quiet for a while
after Jiang Mei Er made such a scene.

23:28.112 --> 23:30.513
I didn't expect business
to become even more prosperous.

23:30.513 --> 23:33.513
Your stepmother dares not to push your father
into forcing you to marry, right?

23:33.513 --> 23:34.513
Of course.

23:34.513 --> 23:36.152
I want them to watch closely.

23:36.152 --> 23:37.953
Who says women can only
serve their husbands and raise children?

23:37.953 --> 23:40.072
We can also thrive in business.

23:40.072 --> 23:41.552
Why depend on others?

23:41.552 --> 23:42.792
Ms. Yan, you have great insight.

23:43.832 --> 23:46.592
Seeing the business of Bofeng thriving,
I can rest assured.

23:46.592 --> 23:49.072
I'll hurry back to the Academy
to review and prepare for Provincial Exam.

23:49.072 --> 23:50.872
Yes, Meng. Focus on the exam.

23:50.872 --> 23:52.193
We'll go to the capital together.

23:52.193 --> 23:53.673
You'll pass with honors.

23:53.673 --> 23:55.592
I'll open a branch.
Not one thing can be missed.

23:55.592 --> 23:57.152
Definitely.

23:57.152 --> 23:58.152
I'll walk you out.

24:03.793 --> 24:05.993
Officers, you've also come to Bofeng to eat?

24:05.993 --> 24:07.713
There are private seats upstairs.
This way, please.

24:07.713 --> 24:09.072
[Notice]

24:09.072 --> 24:10.753
By order of Governor Ding.

24:10.753 --> 24:12.473
Bofeng's food and drink are unclean,

24:12.473 --> 24:13.713
and the building is dilapidated.

24:13.713 --> 24:15.592
It is hereby sealed, effective immediately.

24:15.592 --> 24:17.913
Nonsense! Bofeng was just renovated recently.

24:17.913 --> 24:19.592
And I personally oversee the food and drink.

24:19.592 --> 24:20.872
Insolent!

24:20.872 --> 24:24.152
The government received multiple complaints.
How dare you argue?

24:24.152 --> 24:25.953
All unrelated persons, leave now.

24:28.713 --> 24:29.832
Fu Zhi,

24:29.832 --> 24:32.273
they are deliberately making trouble
because of Jiang Mei Er.

24:32.273 --> 24:33.632
We can't argue against the authority.

24:33.632 --> 24:35.352
Who is in charge here?

24:35.352 --> 24:37.792
You still have your exam.
I am in charge here.

24:37.792 --> 24:39.273
I'm looking for Meng Ting Hui.

24:39.273 --> 24:40.592
I am Meng Ting Hui.

24:40.592 --> 24:42.993
You impersonated Situ Xue
to swindle the people,

24:42.993 --> 24:44.473
illegally amassing wealth.

24:44.473 --> 24:46.753
By order of Governor Ding,
you are to be taken to the Shazhou Prison.

24:46.753 --> 24:49.552
Your document states sealing, not arresting.

24:49.552 --> 24:51.513
The people of Shazhou are watching outside.

24:51.513 --> 24:52.632
So much nonsense.

24:55.513 --> 24:56.753
If you want to arrest someone, arrest me.

24:56.753 --> 24:58.873
Bofeng is mine.
It has nothing to do with Meng.

24:58.873 --> 25:00.473
She's going to take the Imperial Exam
in a few days.

25:00.473 --> 25:02.753
She will never have the qualification again.

25:02.753 --> 25:03.753
Take her away.

25:04.392 --> 25:05.392
[Tea Law, Volume 4]
Meng.

25:07.392 --> 25:08.473
Meng.

25:08.473 --> 25:09.473
[Bofeng]
Meng!

25:09.473 --> 25:11.433
Why is she arrested?

25:11.433 --> 25:13.392
- Can we come to Bofeng to eat in the future?
- Meng.

25:20.552 --> 25:21.552
This way please.

25:26.112 --> 25:27.552
Darn Ding Chong.

25:27.552 --> 25:29.352
Shazhou is arid.
Water is cherished like gold.

25:29.352 --> 25:31.473
For a mouthful of water,
people would sell their own children.

25:31.473 --> 25:32.513
He actually squanders it like this.

25:33.392 --> 25:35.433
What are you talking about?

25:37.392 --> 25:40.632
We said that the golden-threaded nanmu wood
in your mansion

25:40.632 --> 25:43.033
is probably hard to find
even in the imperial palace.

25:43.033 --> 25:44.152
The Governor said,

25:44.152 --> 25:46.953
"The things His Majesty uses are good,
but ours must have even better."

25:48.352 --> 25:49.352
Please.

25:52.072 --> 25:54.592
Master, I'll go kill him right now.

27:10.953 --> 27:14.152
Good! Today's dance is the best.

27:14.152 --> 27:16.592
I'm in a good mood. Everyone gets a reward.

27:19.473 --> 27:21.592
Mr. He from Beijian has arrived.

27:28.233 --> 27:31.552
I am He Du,
from the largest Fu trading house in Beijian.

27:32.193 --> 27:33.592
I've come to Shazhou for the first time
to do business.

27:33.592 --> 27:37.513
I heard you're powerful,
so I came specially to pay a visit.

27:47.832 --> 27:48.832
Doesn't seem like it.

27:57.753 --> 28:02.033
Mr. He, what exactly brings you to Shazhou,

28:02.033 --> 28:04.832
the godforsaken place
plagued by successive years of drought?

28:06.913 --> 28:10.913
Whether it's dry or not
all depends on the Dragon King's mood.

28:10.913 --> 28:12.152
In Shazhou,

28:12.152 --> 28:15.233
aren't you the Dragon King
who commands the wind and rain?

28:18.233 --> 28:21.152
Mr. He,
your approach is indeed extraordinary.

28:21.152 --> 28:23.592
Tell me. What business are you in?

28:23.592 --> 28:26.552
The business I do
is something ordinary people dare not do.

28:27.673 --> 28:28.713
Governor Ding, to be honest with you,

28:29.913 --> 28:32.072
I specialize in taking the paths
the court forbids.

28:33.273 --> 28:36.953
I love doing business
with daring people the most.

28:37.832 --> 28:41.993
However, Shazhou has its own rules.

28:41.993 --> 28:43.072
Here come the rules.

28:56.474 --> 28:59.193
Mr. He, you are a man
who knows the situation.

28:59.913 --> 29:04.352
So is my business in Jiuyou City secure?

29:07.233 --> 29:08.913
In the territory of Shazhou,

29:08.913 --> 29:13.433
even if the Death wants to claim a soul,
he must ask me first.

29:15.193 --> 29:16.193
Look.

29:17.033 --> 29:18.033
[Capable Minister of State]

29:18.033 --> 29:20.713
Personally bestowed by the Left Chancellor.

29:22.513 --> 29:24.352
Capable Minister of State.

29:26.792 --> 29:30.713
Now, even His Majesty
listens to the Left Chancellor.

29:30.713 --> 29:32.112
With his backing,

29:32.112 --> 29:35.233
I have final say in Shazhou.

29:35.954 --> 29:38.953
So you are favored by Left Chancellor.

29:39.792 --> 29:41.312
Then why are you still stuck in Shazhou?

29:42.273 --> 29:44.233
With the Left Chancellor's power,

29:44.233 --> 29:48.152
recommending you to serve in the capital
would be easy.

29:48.152 --> 29:49.392
You mean promotion?

29:50.393 --> 29:53.273
That's all meaningless stuff.

29:53.273 --> 29:57.312
I'm way more free and happy here.

29:57.312 --> 30:00.473
In the capital,
I have to kowtow to His Majesty.

30:00.473 --> 30:05.233
While in Shazhou,
everyone has to kowtow to me.

30:09.033 --> 30:11.233
Governor Ding, you live freely.

30:11.233 --> 30:13.832
You've enlightened me.

30:13.832 --> 30:15.352
So my business deal...

30:15.352 --> 30:18.953
Uncle, Uncle!

30:18.953 --> 30:20.233
- Uncle.
- Brother.

30:20.233 --> 30:23.273
Uncle, have you
caught that madwoman Meng Ting Hui yet?

30:23.273 --> 30:24.832
Can't you see I'm meeting a guest?

30:25.513 --> 30:29.552
A bunch of you from noble families
can't even handle an orphan girl.

30:29.552 --> 30:30.552
How embarrassing!

30:30.552 --> 30:34.152
Brother, all of Shazhou
belongs to our Ding family.

30:34.152 --> 30:36.552
How can we let Mei Er be bullied
by an orphan girl?

30:36.552 --> 30:37.553
We absolutely can't stand it.

30:37.553 --> 30:38.632
I can't stand it, Uncle.

30:38.632 --> 30:39.753
Alright, alright.

30:40.553 --> 30:43.552
I've already sent people to arrest her.

30:43.552 --> 30:46.392
You know, crushing an orphan girl
is easier than stepping on an ant.

30:47.273 --> 30:48.352
Why don't you thank your uncle?

30:48.352 --> 30:50.552
Thank you, Uncle.

30:50.552 --> 30:53.552
I just got a new treasure. Take it.

30:53.552 --> 30:55.792
- Thank you, Uncle. I'll be going then.
- Alright.

30:55.792 --> 30:57.152
Thank you, Brother.

30:57.152 --> 30:58.152
Go ahead.

31:02.513 --> 31:04.753
This niece of mine has been spoiled by me.

31:04.753 --> 31:06.072
Magistrate Wang.

31:06.072 --> 31:09.513
[Travel permit]
Get Mr. He his Jiuyou City travel permit.

31:09.513 --> 31:11.112
Yes.

31:11.112 --> 31:12.392
Thank you, Governor Ding.

31:13.152 --> 31:15.193
Master, please follow me.

31:17.112 --> 31:18.112
Stop.

31:24.753 --> 31:26.993
Mr. He, don't forget.

31:26.993 --> 31:30.233
You must pay this much tribute every month.

31:30.233 --> 31:34.673
If you're short by one coin,
the wild dogs in Shazhou are very hungry.

31:41.511 --> 31:43.630
[Shazhou Government Office]

31:45.913 --> 31:47.433
That corrupt official Ding Chong

31:47.433 --> 31:49.552
is not only greedy,
but also treats human lives like dirt.

32:06.792 --> 32:08.473
Master, you know that female prisoner?

32:09.872 --> 32:11.872
We must close the net tomorrow.

32:11.872 --> 32:12.872
Yes.

32:15.592 --> 32:17.312
This is the deed to the estate under my name.

32:17.312 --> 32:19.273
Go pawn it to ransom Meng.

32:21.713 --> 32:22.993
Here, and this too.

32:22.993 --> 32:25.673
Miss, this is the last dowry
your mother left you.

32:25.673 --> 32:27.152
Meng is in trouble because of me.

32:27.152 --> 32:28.233
I can't just sit back.

32:28.233 --> 32:31.034
If Mother were here,
she would surely agree with what I'm doing.

32:31.034 --> 32:34.312
Ding Chong just wants money, right?
I'll give it to him.

32:34.312 --> 32:35.872
Careful. Hurry up and go.

32:35.872 --> 32:36.872
Yes.

32:38.273 --> 32:40.072
- You've got some nerve!
- Madam.

32:40.072 --> 32:42.112
How dare you
take the property of our Yan family!

32:44.112 --> 32:46.792
This is my dowry left by my mother.
What does it have to do with you?

32:46.792 --> 32:47.792
Yan Fu Zhi,

32:48.713 --> 32:53.072
everything in our Yan family
was earned by your father.

32:53.072 --> 32:55.713
Yet, you betray your own people
to work for outsiders.

32:56.473 --> 32:57.473
How dare you!

32:57.473 --> 33:00.034
I'll beat you to death!

33:00.034 --> 33:02.072
How dare you bully my mother!

33:05.513 --> 33:08.193
Mother!

33:08.193 --> 33:11.033
Song, be good. Don't cry.

33:11.033 --> 33:13.112
Tomorrow, your father will buy you a new one.

33:14.072 --> 33:15.072
Take him to the master.

33:15.072 --> 33:16.072
Yes.

33:18.193 --> 33:19.872
You offended Ding Chong,

33:19.872 --> 33:21.233
and the restaurant was sealed.

33:21.233 --> 33:24.792
Do you know how much money will be given
to Ding Chong to mend this relationship?

33:24.792 --> 33:26.433
- Let's go.
- Stop her.

33:27.713 --> 33:30.353
Move aside. Move aside!

33:30.353 --> 33:31.552
Let go of Miss Yan!

33:33.513 --> 33:34.632
Don't you see it?

33:34.632 --> 33:39.072
Would your father
offend Governor Ding for Meng Ting Hui?

33:39.954 --> 33:42.392
He's arranged a good marriage for you.

33:42.392 --> 33:44.233
Just obediently prepare to get married.

33:46.193 --> 33:47.193
Let me go.

33:47.193 --> 33:50.714
I don't know what kind of spell
that unwanted orphan girl cast on you.

33:50.714 --> 33:53.753
At such a young age,
she dared to lay a hand on Song.

33:53.753 --> 33:55.193
She almost took your brother's life!

33:55.193 --> 33:56.312
I have no brother!

33:59.393 --> 34:04.072
You came into our place
just few days after my mother's death.

34:04.072 --> 34:07.953
It was Meng who accompanied me
through those hard days.

34:07.953 --> 34:09.953
I must rescue Meng.

34:10.672 --> 34:13.994
I must let her take the Imperial Exam.
Let me go!

34:13.994 --> 34:15.993
Meng Ting Hui offended Ding Chong.

34:15.993 --> 34:18.513
She will not walk out of that prison alive.

34:18.513 --> 34:19.953
Forget about it.

34:23.752 --> 34:24.752
Wait.

34:31.752 --> 34:34.752
Aren't you just hoping I'll marry off,
so you can monopolize the Yan family?

34:36.033 --> 34:37.712
If you are willing to rescue Meng,

34:38.632 --> 34:41.344
I will put on the wedding dress

34:43.072 --> 34:44.712
and never mention doing business again.

34:45.552 --> 34:47.513
You know to yield now?

34:49.152 --> 34:51.192
Too late. Let's go.

34:51.993 --> 34:54.033
Miss! Miss!

34:57.592 --> 35:00.673
Let me out! Let me out!

35:00.673 --> 35:02.272
Meng is about to take the Provincial Exam.

35:02.272 --> 35:03.993
She can't be in prison.

35:07.272 --> 35:09.272
She can't be in prison.

35:32.592 --> 35:34.513
Bet big and it's one-two-three.

35:34.513 --> 35:36.672
Bet small and it's three sixes.

35:36.672 --> 35:39.552
- It's weird. Too weird.
- It's weird. Too weird.

35:40.632 --> 35:41.632
Drink!

35:41.632 --> 35:42.632
- Come on.
- Come on.

35:43.232 --> 35:44.232
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

35:47.232 --> 35:50.112
Young lady, let's switch seats.

35:50.112 --> 35:51.192
Your spot has good luck.

35:51.192 --> 35:52.192
Wait.

36:03.513 --> 36:04.513
Come here.

36:07.833 --> 36:09.873
The higher-ups
forbade giving her food or drink.

36:09.873 --> 36:12.393
Now, you're making offerings instead.

36:12.393 --> 36:13.873
Let's stop playing.

36:13.873 --> 36:15.752
No one is leaving. Keep playing.

36:22.112 --> 36:25.192
I heard that prisoners often die accidentally
in the cell.

36:25.192 --> 36:28.913
This time, Meng Ting Hui fell into my hands.
She must be suffering terribly.

36:33.793 --> 36:35.632
Walk faster. Stop dawdling.

36:35.632 --> 36:36.632
Who else would I slap?

36:39.072 --> 36:40.072
- Come on.
- Come on.

36:44.152 --> 36:45.592
Young lady,

36:45.592 --> 36:50.272
when it comes to gambling,
you are top-notch in Shazhou.

36:53.874 --> 36:54.874
- Top-notch.
- Top-notch.

36:54.874 --> 36:56.112
- Impressive.
- Impressive.

36:57.833 --> 37:01.712
Just spar with me for a couple of days,

37:01.712 --> 37:04.632
and your gambling skills
will surely improve a lot.

37:05.873 --> 37:06.873
Meng Ting Hui?

37:21.192 --> 37:24.072
Meng Ting Hui,
let's see how you can still be arrogant.

37:27.192 --> 37:29.192
Don't expect anyone to come save you.

37:29.192 --> 37:31.513
Yan Fu Zhi is in trouble now.

37:32.393 --> 37:34.112
Bofeng is sealed.

37:34.112 --> 37:35.913
She is currently confined
to await her marriage.

37:35.913 --> 37:37.353
The wedding dress is already prepared.

37:37.353 --> 37:39.712
This marriage has been announced
all over Shazhou.

37:40.712 --> 37:43.592
Aren't you dying to get out
and save your good friend?

37:43.592 --> 37:46.072
Too bad. You don't have a chance.

37:48.072 --> 37:52.473
I want you to be trapped here for life,
suffering a lot.

37:56.953 --> 37:58.192
[Dossier]
Come on. Take a look.

37:59.232 --> 38:00.993
After all this fighting,

38:00.993 --> 38:04.152
the dossier still ends up in my hands,
doesn't it?

38:04.152 --> 38:05.353
Give the dossier back to me.

38:06.313 --> 38:08.033
You really want to be an official, don't you?

38:08.953 --> 38:12.632
Fair enough. With your lowly background,

38:12.632 --> 38:15.072
you have no other way out
besides the Imperial Examination.

38:15.712 --> 38:17.632
But I'm different.

38:17.632 --> 38:19.232
The backer behind my uncle

38:19.232 --> 38:22.953
is the Left Chancellor,
second only to His Majesty, above all others.

38:23.913 --> 38:27.033
Above the backer, there is still the law.

38:27.833 --> 38:29.993
If the court knows of your crimes,

38:31.072 --> 38:35.433
they will surely eradicate you
along with your backer.

38:39.993 --> 38:42.672
Stop! Stop!

38:44.072 --> 38:45.072
Stop!

38:48.232 --> 38:49.513
Meng Ting Hui,

38:49.513 --> 38:52.953
I can easily destroy
the thing you treasure as precious.

38:52.953 --> 38:54.913
The dossier is already destroyed.

38:54.913 --> 38:57.833
You'll never set foot in the examination hall
for the rest of your life.

38:59.833 --> 39:01.513
Remember this well.

39:02.232 --> 39:04.592
As long as my uncle is here,

39:04.592 --> 39:09.712
you and Yan Fu Zhi
will never have a day of redemption.

39:14.913 --> 39:16.433
Meng Ting Hui, you...

39:16.433 --> 39:18.592
Xia, hurry! Release the venomous snakes!

39:28.152 --> 39:31.632
Xia! Meng Ting Hui, just you wait!

39:31.632 --> 39:33.152
I'll come torture you every day!

39:33.152 --> 39:34.913
I'll make you suffer a lot!

40:14.353 --> 40:17.953
Remember.
A top pickpocket takes money quickly,

40:17.953 --> 40:19.272
without even leaving a red mark!

40:20.192 --> 40:21.192
You try.

40:36.192 --> 40:37.192
Ting Hui!

40:38.793 --> 40:39.793
Move!

40:54.712 --> 40:55.793
Ting Hui!

42:07.072 --> 42:08.752
Help! Someone escaped!

42:10.793 --> 42:11.833
Someone escaped!

42:11.833 --> 42:13.552
A prisoner escaped!

42:13.552 --> 42:14.793
A prisoner has escaped!

42:17.353 --> 42:18.513
Who? Who escaped?

42:18.513 --> 42:20.473
Meng Ting Hui. It's Meng Ting Hui.

42:20.473 --> 42:22.393
Meng Ting Hui? Split up to search.

42:22.393 --> 42:23.393
- Yes.
- Yes.

42:24.552 --> 42:25.552
Move aside!

42:26.152 --> 42:28.353
Everyone, move aside!

42:28.353 --> 42:29.513
Move aside!

42:31.834 --> 42:32.834
Someone escaped from prison.

42:32.834 --> 42:33.993
Hurry! Seal the city gates!

42:35.953 --> 42:36.953
Close the gates!

42:44.433 --> 42:45.433
Open the gates.

42:51.913 --> 42:54.313
You entered the city so late.
Where are you from?

42:54.313 --> 42:55.833
From the capital.
I'm here to visit relatives.

42:58.272 --> 42:59.272
- Let's go.
- Close the gates.
